  "purpose": "<p>The Foreign Affairs Committee examines the expenditure, administration and policy of the Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) and other bodies associated with the Foreign Office and within the Committee's remit, including the British Council.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘<a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Committee Corridor</a>’</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/78/foreign-affairs-committee/content/174757/role/\">Find out more about this committee</a></p>",
